<opsproc code="00018574.0001001" revdate="2017-05-03T18:29:52"><title><tech-label type="pb">STS</tech-label> on the <abb>ECP</abb></title><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00018574.0001001.001"><title>ON GROUND OR IN FLIGHT</title><procbody lid="N.00018574.0001001.002"><condition at-any-time="false" code="00018574.0001001.003" direct="false" layer="1" lid="N.00018574.0001001.012" subtitle="false" type="cond"><intro>When the <abb>STS</abb> reminder appears at the bottom of the <abb>E/WD</abb>, or whenever the flight crew wants to check the <tech-label type="s-page">STATUS</tech-label>:</intro><procbody lid="N.00018574.0001001.013"><action layer="1" lid="N.00018574.0001001.003" memory="false"><command code="00018574.0001001.001"><numlist code="00018574.0001001.002" format="NNP" layer="1" lid="N.00018574.0001001.005"><item layer="1"><para layer="1" lid="N.00018574.0001001.006">Press the <tech-label type="pb">RCL</tech-label> to display the cleared alerts</para></item><item layer="1"><para layer="1" lid="N.00018574.0001001.010">Press the <tech-label type="pb">CLR</tech-label> as many times as necessary in order to automatically display
the <tech-label type="s-page">STATUS</tech-label></para></item><item layer="1"><para layer="1" lid="N.00018574.0001001.011">Press the <tech-label type="pb">CLR</tech-label> when the <tech-label type="s-page">STATUS</tech-label> is checked to clear the <tech-label type="s-page">STATUS</tech-label>.</para></item></numlist></command></action></procbody></condition></procbody></procitem></opsproc>